            "created_at": "2026-09-25T20:41:15.805Z",
            "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone!</p>\n<p>I’m an AI Automation Specialist working mainly with <strong>n8n, AI/LLM APIs, REST APIs, webhooks, Google Sheets, email, and messaging integrations</strong>.</p>\n<p>I’m currently available for <strong>small and medium-sized freelance automation projects</strong>.</p>\n<p>I can help with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AI-powered workflows</li>\n<li>API integrations</li>\n<li>Lead processing and qualification</li>\n<li>Google Sheets automations</li>\n<li>Follow-up and reminder systems</li>\n<li>AI data extraction and classification</li>\n<li>Automated research and reporting</li>\n<li>Email / Telegram notifications</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Some of my recent demo projects:</p>\n<p><strong>AI Lead Qualification</strong><br>\nUnstructured inquiry → AI extraction → lead scoring → structured data → Google Sheets → manager notification</p>\n<p><strong>AI Research &amp; Reporting</strong><br>\nAPI data → AI analysis → filtering → aggregation → automated report → email</p>\n<p><strong>Lead Lifecycle Automation</strong><br>\nNew lead → AI analysis → status management → scheduled follow-up → automatic reminder</p>\n<p>I’m especially interested in well-defined automation projects where I can help replace repetitive manual work with a simple n8n workflow.</p>\n<p><strong>Portfolio:</strong> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/150wuKTUC39GeIEPcBtdPLn3eUzoTLj2BwXtPwsPjM5c/edit?usp=sharing\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">PORTFOLIO: MARIYA BUGLIVYKH - Google Docs</a></p>\n<p><strong>Upwork</strong>:<a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~01160686e16631cee6?mp_source=share\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.upwork.com/freelancers/~01160686e16631cee6?mp_source=share</a></p>\n<p><strong>LinkedIn:</strong><a> </a><a href=\"http://www.linkedin.com/in/mariya-buglivykh-569817439\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">www.linkedin.com/in/mariya-buglivykh-569817439</a></p>\n<p>Feel free to DM me if you have a workflow you’d like to automate.</p>",
